#: .\templates\account\email\account_already_exists_message.txt:4
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You are receiving this email because you or someone else tried to signup for "
"an\n"
"account using email address:\n"
"\n"
"%(email)s\n"
"\n"
"However, an account using that email address already exists.  In case you "
"have\n"
"forgotten about this, please use the password forgotten procedure to "
"recover\n"
"your account:\n"
"\n"
"%(password_reset_url)s"
msgstr ""
"Vous recevez cet e-mail parce que vous ou quelqu'un d'autre a essayé de créer\n"
"un compte en utilisant l'adresse e-mail :\n"
"\n"
"%(email)s\n"
"\n"
"Cependant, un compte utilisant cette adresse e-mail existe déjà. Si vous\n"
"l'aviez oublié, veuillez utiliser la procédure de mot de passe oublié pour\n"
"récupérer votre compte :\n"
"\n"
"%(password_reset_url)s"

#: .\templates\account\email\account_already_exists_subject.txt:3
msgid "Account Already Exists"
msgstr "Le compte existe déjà"

#: .\templates\account\email\base_message.txt:1
#, python-format
